<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWA IKABILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tim.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWA IKABILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha ikabili cha Timoteo kicho lupwilili lwa ikabili lwandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo ha mwanahina wake Timoteo. Kitabu cha ikabili cha Timoteo chandikigwa behi na ikimambukizo cha ugima wa Paulo. Kipigiti kino Paulo kakala mkifungo mdiwambo da Loma (1:16). Paulo kakala yamnogele ng'hani Timoteo, na mianza bwando kamulagusa kamba mwanage (Flp. 2:22 na 1Tim. 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Luno lulo lupwilili lumwe mmwanza wa mhwilili nne zayandike Paulo ha munhu imweimwe uhaleka zija zayandike ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. Mhwilili ndatu ziyagwe zizo lupwilili lwa ichanduso lwa Timoteo, lupwilili lwa Tito, na lupwilili lwa Filimoni. Kipigiti vichandikigwe kitabu cha ikabili cha Timoteo, wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wakalile muutawala wa Kiloma wakala wogazigwa. Yodahika kamba kino kikala kilamso cha Paulo kwikigwa mkifungo na kakala yomulagiza Timoteo kwazaganya migayo. Kamba mkitabu cha ichanduso cha Timoteo, Paulo komzuma ng'hani Timoteo mmbuli ya wakulufunzi wa uvwizi (1Tim. 1:16-18). Vivija komulongela Timoteo kamba kowa na vipigiti vidala hamwande (3:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo kosonga na kumulamsa Timoteo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>) na abaho komgangamiza (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-18">1:3-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho komulongela Timoteo yawe na mwazaganyo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho Paulo kolava ndagizi (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho komzuma mmbuli ya gaja gondagalawilile hamwande na nzila inogile ya kugahuma (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 3:1-4:8">3:1—4:8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paulo komambukiza na kulava mbuli zake mwenyego ha Timoteo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:9-22">4:9-22</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, yasaguligwe na manogelwa ga Mulungu kuwa mtumigwa wa Kilisto Yesu. Nitumigwa kuwalongela wanhu mbuli ya ugima wa digunge Mulungu uyekile kilagano na tweye kubitila nhamanila mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Nokwandikila gweye, Timoteo, mwanangu mnogelwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Ngekewa, bazi, na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata na kulawa ha Kilisto Yesu Mndewa wetu viwe hamoja nagwe.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulava Hewela na Kugangamizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Nomuheweza Mulungu, ayo inimsang'hanikila na udaho ung'alile wa kusambula gehile na ganogile kamba viwatendile wahenga zangu. Imisi na ikilo mazua gose sikusemwa gweye mnhambiko zangu. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Nosulukila kukona kabili, kwavija nokumbukila mahozi gako kipigiti vitukalile tuilaga. Na nokwiza kudeng'ha ng'hani tuhawa hamoja kabili. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Niikumbukila nhamanila yako ya ikweli, ayo iwakalile nayo bibi yako Loisi na mamaako Yunike, sambi na nie notogola kamba na gweye kunayo. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Sama ya kilamso kino, nokukumbusa kamba sambiuikome nhunza iyakugwelele Mulungu kipigiti vinikwikile makono gangu. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Kwavija Mulungu hatugwelele Loho wake giladi yatugele bwembwe, ila katugwelela Loho wa kutugela mhiko, noge, na kuizuila.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Avo sambiwone kinyala kumulonga Mndewa wetu ha wanhu wayagwe, ama sambiunyonele kinyala nie, nili mfungigwa sama ya Kilisto. Sama ya mhiko Mulungu ziyakugwelele, uisasale kugaya hamoja na nie sama ya Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Kwavija Mulungu katukombola na katukema tukale ukazi ung'alile. Katenda vino si sama ya gaja gatutendile, ila kwavija vino vivo vimnogele mwenyego. Ngekewa ino tugweleligwa kubitila Kilisto Yesu songela ulumwengu haunalumbigwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Ila sambisambi ngekewa ino igubuligwa kumwetu kubitila kwiza kwa Mkombola wetu Kilisto Yesu. Heyo kazimambukiza mhiko za ifa, na kubitila Usenga Unogile kaugubula ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="2TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Mulungu kanisagula nie kuwa mpeta Usenga Unogile, mtumigwa wa Kilisto, na mkulufunzi. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Kino kicho kilamso cha nie kugazika. Ila sikona kinyala kwavija nimtanga heyo inimtamanila, na notogola kamba heyo kodaha kukiimiliza kija kinigweleligwe mbaka zua dija dondayabwele Mndewa. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Zinanahile ng'hani mbuli za ikweli zinikufundize, ziwe kamba ningo ya gweye kuikweleleza, na usigale muinhamanila na mdinoge jetu mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Vigogeni vinhu vinogile vumgweleligwe mkutazigwa na Loho wa Mulungu yokala mgati yetu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Kuvitanga kamba Figela na Helimogene hamoja na wanhu wose muisi ya Asia wandeka. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Mndewa yawaonele bazi wanhu wali mng'anda ya Onesifolo, kwavija Onesifolo mianza bwando kausuluza moyo wangu, na honile kinyala sama yangu nie avija vinikalile mkifungo. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Kipigiti viyavikile mdiwambo da Loma, hima kasonga kunizahila mbaka kanyona. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Mndewa yamonele bazi mdizua dondayeze Kilisto! Gweye kovitanga goya mianza mingahi iyanitazile nie mdiwambo da Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Asikali Yanogile wa Kilisto Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Avo, gweye mwanangu, ugangamizwe mngekewa ija Mulungu iyokugwelela mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Gasole mafundo gaja gaunihulike nie nifundiza haulongozi wa wanhu bwando, na uwagwelele wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye awo wondawadahe kuwafundiza wayagwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Wazaganye migayo hamoja na nie kamba asikali yanogile wa Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Haduhu asikali yosang'hanika na mbuli za wanhu hawali asikali, ila kolonda kumnogeza mkulu wake. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Mkimbila yokimbila mumkimbilo wa wanhu bwando hadaha kugweleligwa nhunza kamba hazigogile ndagizi. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Mulimi yalimile ng'hani kolondigwa yawe wa ichanduso kubokela fungu jake da vakuja. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Kigelegeze kino kinilonga, kwavija Mndewa kokugwaa udaho wa kuzitanga mbuli zino zose.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Mkumbuke Yesu Kilisto, yazusigwe kulawa mkudanganhika, ayo yakalile wa lukolo lwa Daudi, kamba vinikalile nifundiza Muusenga Unogile unikalile niupeta. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Kwavija niupeta Usenga Unogile, nogaya na hata kufungigwa na minyolo kamba mtenda gehile. Ila mbuli ya Mulungu haifungigwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Avo nochazaganya kila kinhu sama ya wanhu wasaguligwe na Mulungu, giladi na hewo vivija wapate ukombola awo wiza kubitila Kilisto Yesu na kugala yenzi ya digunge. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Ulonzi uno wa ikweli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Kamba tuhadanganhika hamoja na heyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">vivija towa wagima hamoja na heyo.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Kamba tuhagendelela kwazaganya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">totawala hamoja na heyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Kamba tuham'bela heyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">na heyo vivija kotubela.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Kamba tweye twa vizenzeleganye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">heyo kosigala kuwa bule uzenzeleganye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">kwavija heyo hadaha kuibela mwenyego.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Msang'hana Yatogoligwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Uwakumbuse wanhu zako mbuli zino, na uwazume haulongozi wa Mulungu kamba sambiwagombe sama ya mbuli. Ngomba kamba zino hazimzenga munhu yoyose ila zowabananga waja wozitegeleza. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Iyohe giladi utogoligwe hameso ga Mulungu, kamba msang'hana yalekile kugeligwa kinyala na sang'hano yake, na uwe munhu yofundiza Usenga wa kweli ya Mulungu vinogile. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Kala kutali na mbuli zili si za Mulungu na mbuli za kibozi, kwavija mbuli hizo zowalongoza wanhu wawe kutali ng'hani na Mulungu. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Mafundizo gano ga kamba londa dikwenela lukuli lose. Wanhu wabili wakalile wofundiza mbuli zino wakala Himenayo na Fileto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Waileka nzila ya kweli na kuitenda nhamanila ya wanhu wayagwe wamtogole Kilisto idungwedungwe mkulonga kamba mzuso ubita wisha. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Ila msingi ugangamale Mulungu uyawikile haudahika kutigiswa, na uchana ya msingi uno zandikigwa mbuli zino, “Mndewa kowatanga waja wali wanhu zake,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">MHETA 16:5</ref></char>.</note> na, “Wose wolonga kamba hewo wa wanhu wa Mndewa wolondigwa waleke kutenda gehile.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Muna ing'anda ya mgoli muna via bwando va namna zose, viyagwe va madini ga feza, viyagwe va zahabu, viyagwe va mibiki, na viyagwe va ulongo. Viyagwe vitendigwa sama ya vinhu kisinyo, na viyagwe sama ya vinhu vizoeleke mazua gose. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Vino vivo vondaiwe ha munhu yoyose yoing'aliza na kuwa kutali na vinhu vose vihile, kowa kinhu kitendigwe sama ya vinhu kisinyo, kwavija kowa na ukazi ung'alile na kowa munhu yaisasale kusang'hanikizwa na Mndewa mmbuli zose zinogile. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Avo inege na sulukila zihile za umhale, na iyohe kukala ukazi wa kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, nhamanila, noge, na tindiwalo, hamoja na awo womkema Mulungu na mioyo inogile. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Ila uinege na mbamila za kibozi na za kijinga, kwavija gweye kuvitanga kamba zimambukizilaga muingomba. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Gweye kamba mtumigwa wa Mndewa hulondigwa kugomba na munhu. Ila kolondigwa umnogele kila munhu, na uwe mkulufunzi unogile uli na mwazaganyo. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Uwe munhu yaholile kipigiti vuuwagolosa waja wokubeza, kwavija siku Mulungu koigalula mioyo ya wanhu waja na kwiza kuitanga ikweli. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Abaho wabwele mnzonzi zao na kuhonyokwa kulawa mumtego wa Mwenembago, ayo yawanamate na kuwatenda watende gaja goyolonda heyo.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Mazua ga Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Ila kolondigwa uitange mbuli ino, Timoteo, kamba kuna gamazua ga kimambukizo kowa na vipigiti vidala. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Wanhu wowa wene kuinogela wenyego, wene kunogela hela, wene kuitogola, wene matopa, na wene maligo. Hawawategeleza tata zao na mama zao, walibule hewela, wanyolodoke mmioyo, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>walibule unhu, wolema kuwagela wayao kumgongo, wowalonga vihile wayao, woleka kuizuila, wakaini, na wokwihilwa na mbuli zinogile. <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Wanhu wano wowa vizenzeleganye, hawawagesa wanhu wayagwe, wowa wene kulonda makulu, na wowa wene kunogelwa na mbuli za uhondo wa ulumwengu uno kubanza kumnogela Mulungu. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Kunze wa kamba wanhu wa Mulungu, ila wozibeza mhiko zake. Ukale nao kutali wanhu kamba wano. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Kwavija mmwanza wao hana wanhu wokiitenda kuwa wambwiga wokwingila mzing'anda za watwanzi wabozi wagubikizwe na vilozo viwali navo na kuhembeluswa na sulukila za kila namna. Wolonda wagatogole mafundo gao ga uvwizi. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Watwanzi awo mazua gose wolonda kuifundiza ila hawadaha kwiza kuitanga ikweli. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Kamba vija Yane na Yambile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yane na Yambile </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hawandikwe M'bibilia ila muusheha wa Wayahudi wolongigwa kamba wakala wahawi wa Falao wam'bezile Musa. Nyandiko zino za mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 7:11-12">KUHALAWA 7:11-12</ref></char>.</note> viwam'bezile Musa umwaka, vivija wanhu wano waibamilila ikweli, wanhu wali na nzonzi zipotoke, na wahumwile mnhamanila. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Ila hawavika kutali ng'hani, kwavija kila munhu kowona vija viwali wabozi. Vino vivo viwalawilile Yane na Yambile.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Ila gweye, Timoteo, kuvitanga vija vinifundiza na vija vinikala, na kugatanga gaja gali mmoyo wangu. Kuitanga nhamanila yangu, vija vinili na mwazaganyo na noge, na vija vinidaha kwazaganya. <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>Kuitanga migayo yangu na kugazika kunigazike. Kugatanga gose ganilawilile nie mmiwambo ya Antiokia, Ikonio, na Listila, migayo ihile inyazaganye, ila Mndewa kanikombola kulawa mmigayo ija yose. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Kila munhu yolonda kukala ukazi wa kumnogela Mulungu mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu kogazigwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Ila wanhu wehile na wazenzeleganye wogaluka kulawa kuwiho na kuwa wanhu wehile ng'hani, kuno wowavwizila wayagwe na hewo wenyego kuvwiziligwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Ila gweye gendelela na gaja gauifundize na gaugatogole ng'hani, kwavija kumtanga ija yakufundize. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Na kuvitanga kamba songela vuukalile mdodo kufundizigwa Nyandiko Zing'alile, zikugwelele ng'hungwe za kuubokela ukombola awo wiza kubitila nhamanila mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Nyandiko zose Zing'alile zina Loho wa Mulungu, na zolumba kufundiza gaja gali kweli, kukomhokela gehile, kugolosa haveduke, na kufundiza kukala ukazi ulibule uzenzeleganye, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>avo munhu wa Mulungu yatimamie na yawe na vihendo vose va kutenda kila sang'hano inogile.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Haulongozi wa Mulungu na haulongozi wa Kilisto Yesu, ayo yondayawataguse iwagima na wadanganhike, na kwavija heyo kokwiza kutawala kamba Mndewa, nokulagiza, <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>uupete Usenga Unogile, uisasale mkipigiti kilumbile na mkipigiti hakilumbile, fundiza, komhokela, na gangamiza, na ufundize na mwazaganyo mkulu. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Kipigiti chokwiza cha wanhu kugalema mafundizo ga ikweli, ila woziwinza sulukila zao wenyego na woilundikila wakulufunzi bwando wondawawalongele gaja gowosulukila hewo kugahulika. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Wolema kuzitegeleza mbuli za ikweli, na wosonga kuzitegeleza simulizi za uvwizi. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Ila gweye, uizuile mzimbuli zose, uyazaganye migayo, tenda sang'hano ya mpeta Usenga Unogile, na ugatende gose gayakugwelele Mulungu kamba mtumigwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Kwavija nie kipigiti changu kivika cha kulavigwa nhosa. Kipigiti cha nie kusegela muulumwengu uno kikwenhuka. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Nigomba ngomba inogile, mkimbilo niumambukiza, na nhamanila nisigala nayo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Na sambi nikiligwa mkungo wa kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, awo Mndewa, mulamula yalibule uzenzeleganye, wondayanigwelele kuna dizua dondayabwele. Ila sio nie niiyeka, ila vivija na waja wose wakalile wonogelwa kumona mkipigiti cha kwiza kumwake. <figure style="fig" alt="Wreath crown" file="BK00157C.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="4:8">Mkungo wa Kuwa Bule Uzenzeleganye</figure><verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi za Kiunhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Tenda vuudahile wize kumwangu himahima, <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>kwavija Dema, kanogelwa na ulumwengu uno avo kanileka kachola kudiwambo da Tesalonike. Kilesike kachola muisi ya Galatia, na Tito kachola muisi ya Dalumatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luka yeiyeka iyo yali hamoja na nie. Msole Maluko wize nayo, kwavija heyo iyo yodaha kunitaza muisang'hano yangu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Nimtuma Tikiko yachole kudiwambo da Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Uheza ngalila koti jangu, dija dinidilekile mmakono ga Kalipo mdiwambo da Toloa, vivija nigalile na vitabu vangu, ng'haning'hani vija vitendigwe na kwembe.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Alekizanda, ija imuhunzi, kanitendela mbuli zihile ng'hani. Mndewa komuliha galingile na gaja gayatendile. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Gweye vivija umteganye, kwavija kagabeza na mhiko zake zose gaja gose gatulongile.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Mmwanza wangu wa ichanduso kugaligwa ha mulamula haduhu munhu yangombeleze, ila wanhu wose wanileka. Mulungu sambiyawapetele nhaguso ino. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Ila Mndewa kema hamoja na nie na kunigela mhiko, avo kubitila nie Usenga Unogile upetigwe bila kusigazwa na Wamhazi wose wauhulike. Avo nikomboligwa kulawa mnhaguso ya ifa. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Mndewa konikombola kulawa mzimbuli zose zihile na kunisola mkuniimiliza na kunigala kuna uundewa wake wa kuulanga. Yenzi iwe kumwake milongo yose. Amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndamsa za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Walamse Pilisila na Akuila, hamoja na wanhu wali mng'anda ya Onesifolo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elasto kasigala mdiwambo da Kolinto. Na nie nimuleka Tulofimo mdiwambo da Mileto kwavija kakala mtamu. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Tenda vuudahile kwiza kipigiti cha kihuhe king'hali hakinavika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Yubulo, Pude, Lino, na Klaudia hamoja na wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto, wokulamsa.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Mndewa yakale na loho yako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Ngekewa ya Mulungu iwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
